OL,3,GNEWSATeacher who sexually abused 12
OL,4,Apupils jailed for four years
OL,5,
OL,6,FA teacher who sexually abused 12 pupils
OL,7,Fat a school in Paisley has been jailed
OL,8,Ffor four years.
OL,10,FMartin Gallacher, 46, groomed and
OL,11,Fabused vulnerable boys over an 11-year
OL,12,Fperiod.
OL,14,FHe targeted them in his classes and at
OL,15,Flunch, as well as badminton and
OL,16,Ffootball clubs he ran within the
OL,17,Fschool.
